- [Amdocs connectX](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/bss-oss/connectx): Cloud-native "telco-in-a-box" SaaS platform for launching digital and MVNO brands.
- [Financial Services Solutions](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/financial-services): Cloud, AI, and modernization solutions for banks and financial institutions.
- [Digital Financial Services (DFS) Platform](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/digital-financial-services): Mobile-wallet platform for storing, transferring, saving, and lending money.
- [MarketONE for Financial Services](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/marketone-for-financial-services): SaaS marketplace for bundling third-party digital and financial services.
- [Network Support Solutions](https://www.amdocs.com/network-support): GenAI-driven network operations and assurance offerings.
- [Amdocs eSIM Cloud](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/bss-oss/esim): The Market Leading eSIM Orchestration & Entitlement Platform.
- [Entitlement Server by eSIM Cloud](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/bss-oss/esim/entitlement-server): Enabling Seamless Device Entitlements, Subscriptions, and Advanced Digital Services.
- [Monetization](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/bss-oss/monetization): A cloud-native, open, agile solution for monetizing 5G services, IoT and smart spaces.
- [Intelligent Networking Suite](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/bss-oss/intelligent-networking-suite): Telco-grade, open automation that helps CSPs run end-to-end service and network lifecycles.
- [Amdocs Matrixx Charging](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/bss-oss/monetization/matrixx-charging):  a cloud native, real-time charging and monetization engine designed for advanced consumption-based business models.
- [Network Deployment & Optimization Suite](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/bss-oss/network-deployment-optimization-suite):  Analytics-driven scalable platform, providing a unified workspace for all network analytics and optimization operations for 5G, 4G/LTE and converged mobile networks.
- [Autonomous Network Operations](https://www.amdocs.com/products-services/aos/agentic-business-and-network-workflows/autonomous-network-operations):  AI agents execute work end-to-end across network domains – delivering services, resolving issues, optimizing performance, and managing capacity autonomously.

